      "start_frame": 819,
      "duration_frames": 440,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "004-contradiction",
      "role": "female",
      "text": "一边收缩，一边投入。它到底是在主动布局，还是在硬扛压力？",
